---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { heroSrcset } from '../../utils/images';
---

<Layout
  title="Breakfast | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Start the day with local pastries, fresh fruit, and excellent coffee at Toile Blanche."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/breakfast/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-27.jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">The Morning</p>
        <h1>Breakfast</h1>
        <p class="info-tagline">Coffee, croissants, and the sound of the garden waking up. One of the things guests remember most.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bkf-grid" aria-label="Breakfast gallery">
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/1.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="4898" height="3265" alt="Breakfast spread at Toile Blanche" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/2.jpeg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="3024" height="3780" alt="Breakfast at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/3.JPG" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="4898" height="3265" alt="Morning at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/4.jpeg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="3024" height="3780" alt="Breakfast details at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/5.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="4898" height="3265" alt="Breakfast terrace at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="bkf-grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/6.jpeg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 33.33vw" width="3024" height="3780" alt="Coffee and breakfast at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <h2>No need to rush</h2>
        <p>Whether you are an early riser wanting to start the day as soon as possible, or a late sleeper, you can take breakfast at your own pace.</p>

        <h2>What to expect</h2>
        <p>Fresh bread and pastries from a local bakery. Seasonal fruit. Eggs prepared as you like them. Excellent coffee, and plenty of it. Local honey, jams, and cheeses. Orange juice pressed that morning.</p>

        <h2>Included with every direct booking</h2>
        <p>Every direct reservation includes Le petit déjeuner façon Toile Blanche for two, a set morning menu built around La Cueillette. Additional dishes from the à la carte are available and charged separately.</p>
        <p>Breakfast is not included with reservations made through third-party platforms.</p>

        <h2>Hours</h2>
        <p>Breakfast is served every day from <strong>8:00 AM to 10:30 AM</strong> in Le Restaurant.</p>
        <p>If you need an earlier start, please let reception know the evening before and we will arrange something.</p>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';

  .info-header {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .bkf-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
  }
  .bkf-grid-item {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bkf-grid-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(1) img { object-position: 50% 42%; }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(2) img { object-position: 45% 50%; }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(3) img { object-position: 62% 45%; }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(4) img { object-position: 58% 45%; }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(5) img { object-position: 38% 56%; }
  .bkf-grid-item:nth-child(6) img { object-position: 50% 62%; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bkf-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .bkf-grid-item {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    }
  }
</style>
